  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for grok-build",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for grok-build fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in grok-build:\n\n- CVE-2026-109349: gix-pack pack version 3 header assertion\n  failure (boo#1285155)\n- CVE-2026-109350: gix-pack ofs-delta base-distance handling\n  flaw (boo#1285155)\n- CVE-2026-109351: gix-pack header object-count denial of\n  service (boo#1285155)\n- Refresh vendored Rust dependencies (gix 0.83.0 -\u003e 0.88.0,\n  gix-pack 0.70.0 -\u003e 0.75.0, gix-status 0.30.0 -\u003e 0.35.0);\n  re-audited licences (913 external crates in the shipped\n  graph, 1247 vendored); licence set unchanged\n- adapt xai-fast-worktree to the gix 0.88 API (anyhow Context bound, from_bstr signature)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
